response:
The report describes a cyberattack campaign tracked as UAC-0198 targeting Ukrainian government and municipal computers. Phishing emails masquerading as the Security Service of Ukraine distributed links pointing to pCloud storage (filedn.eu) hosting malicious MSI/EXE files, which deploy the remote access malware ANONVNC (derived from the open-source MeshAgent).

